lodepng.c for C; `-x c` does the same without touching the file) and
-DLODEPNG_NO_COMPILE_DISK -DLODEPNG_NO_COMPILE_CPP
-DLODEPNG_NO_COMPILE_ANCILLARY_CHUNKS. The encoder is compiled in (since 2026-09-28)
for the fallback clock's preview PNG (tt7d/fallback_screen.c) and the clock face
test's renders. See the top-level Makefile.
